        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Commission Rate 8.25% for full-time employees, 7.00% for part-time employees. Any Part-time employees on roll as of 8-20-1999 will receive 8.25% commission. For the first year new full-time employees may be paid 1% less than the applicable rate.",
