        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The ratio of Full-time to Part-time employees in all Grade V departments shall be three full-time to one part-time or less. If the current ratio is less than 3:1 as of date of ratification of this agreement than that current ratio shall stay in effect for the life of this agreement. If the current ratio is more than 3:1 as of date of ratification of this agreement the Employer will within 3 months bring the ratio into compliance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                349,
                460,
