        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Any Grade V employee who, during the term of the agreement, transfers to another department in the store, shall receive a prorated bonus based on hours worked in the Grade V department during the quarter in which the transfer was processed. The past practice of requiring associates to be on roll as of the date the bonus is paid in order to be eligible to receive the bonus payment shall continue.",
